description: Rules for implementing the maintenance logic loop using @cursor/sdk.

globs: ["src/agents//*.ts", "src/orchestrator//*"]

Maintenance Loop Protocol

Discovery: Use agent.send with @codebase references to find the bug's root cause.   

Reproduction: Synthetic tests (traceback_repro.test.ts) MUST fail before the fix phase starts.

Surgical Coding: Prefer GPT-5.4 Codex for the implementation phase. Bias toward "minimal edits" to preserve project patterns.   

Safety:

Subagent depth limit: 1.

Never allow agents to modify .env or configuration files unless explicitly authorized.